# Identity second opinion by hand (scripts/second_opinion_manual.py). The exported shards hold unmasked names, dates of
# birth and phone numbers: everything in this folder stays local except the verdicts, which hold only a pair hash, the
# verdict and a generic reason, and are shared so every machine can import the same judgements.
data/review/second_opinion/*
!data/review/second_opinion/verdicts_*.jsonl

